
units metal
atom_style molecular
boundary s s s    #non-periodic

# System definition
read_restart step_2_down.init.restart

# set groups
group free type 1 2
group pinanchor type  3 4
group posy type  5 6
group center type  7 8
group base type 9 10 #keep it anchored


# Pair Coefficients
pair_style	airebo 3.0 1 0
pair_coeff * * CH.airebo C H C H C H C H C H

#####Just run for a bit and let things ring out some

#freeze the jig atoms atoms
fix anchorfix pinanchor setforce 0.0 0.0 0.0 #first is ID = user-assigned name for the fix,  ID of the group of atoms
velocity pinanchor set 0.0 0.0 0.0

fix anchorposy posy setforce 0.0 0.0 0.0 #first is ID = user-assigned name for the fix,  ID of the group of atoms
velocity posy set 0.0 0.0 0.0

fix anchorcenter center setforce 0.0 0.0 0.0 #first is ID = user-assigned name for the fix,  ID of the group of atoms
velocity center set 0.0 0.0 0.0

fix basefix base setforce 0.0 0.0 0.0 #first is ID = user-assigned name for the fix,  ID of the group of atoms
velocity base set 0.0 0.0 0.0

# Equilibrate to 90K
fix nve all nve
timestep 0.00025
fix freefix free temp/berendsen 90. 90. 0.25

dump ring_out all custom 1000 step3_wait.lammpstrj id type x y z vx vy vz
run 40000
thermo 500

undump ring_out

write_restart step_3_wait.init.restart
